Smart Shield/Argo: monitor Cloudflare changelog. Always check editability before attempting to enable/disable Argo. Set up billing notifications. Combine with Tiered Cache. Use in production only - disable for dev/staging to control costs. Monitor analytics - require 500+ requests in 48h for detailed metrics. Handle errors gracefully - check for billing, permissions, zone compatibility. Test configuration changes in staging before production. Use TypeScript SDK. Implement retry logic. Document zone-specific settings.

Enterprise+; billing/payment configured; token `Zone:Argo Smart Routing:Edit`; contact support if unclear. Verify `editable: true`; if false, check billing, plan, holds/suspensions, scopes.

```ts
const status = await client.argo.smartRouting.get({ zone_id: zoneId });
if (!status.editable) { throw new Error("Argo is not editable for this zone"); }
await client.argo.smartRouting.edit({ zone_id: zoneId, value: "on" });
```

429: typically 1200 requests/5 minutes; use `RateLimitError`, `retry-after`, exponential backoff. Metrics latency 1-5 minutes; proxied only; DDoS/WAF exemption; Spectrum no hard limit.
